,"fmp_official_ev":33361.3,"enterpriseValueBasis":"USD market capitalization + USD debt - USD cash and short-term investments","dcf_model_ev":20345.6,"ev_to_ebitda":18,"debt_to_ebitda":1.22,"net_debt_to_ebitda":-0.82,"f_score":3,"f_score_breakdown":[],"fair_val":32.22,"default_fair_val":32.22,"premium_pct":60.2,"is_undervalued":false,"pe_trailing":24,"pe_forward":21.1,"pb_trailing":-34647.3,"pb_forward":-31182.6,"div_yield":0,"ps_ratio":5.5,"fcf_to_ev":4.69,"fcf_to_mcap":4.51,"liab_to_assets":100.3,"cash_to_assets":31.8,"current_ratio":0.8,"roe":97200,"roa":-9.7,"moat":{"m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":3},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":6},"m4_network_effects":{"score":9},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":5},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":2},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":8},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":8},"m10_durability":{"score":7},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Roblox 的護城河主要建立在其強大的網絡效應（M4）和用戶保留率（M9）之上，這使其成為一個難以撼動的虛擬世界平台。其品牌吸引力（M1）和用戶生成內容模式帶來的運營效率（M7）與資本配置（M8）也為其提供了堅實的基礎。然而，其對專利和監管的依賴性較低（M2），且規模成本優勢（M5）和地理資產（M6）並非其核心壁壘。轉換成本（M3）對核心用戶有效，但對普通用戶較弱。總體而言，Roblox 展現了類似於「收費橋」的特徵，即一旦用戶和創作者進入並投入，就難以離開，其價值在於連接海量用戶與創作者的生態系統。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Roblox's moat is primarily built upon its strong network effects (M4) and customer retention (M9), establishing it as a formidable virtual world platform. Its brand appeal (M1) and the operational efficiency (M7) and capital allocation (M8) derived from its user-generated content model provide a solid foundation. However, its low reliance on patents and regulation (M2), and its scale cost advantages (M5) and geographic assets (M6) are not its core barriers. Switching costs (M3) are effective for core users but weaker for casual ones. Overall, Roblox exhibits characteristics akin to a 'toll bridge,' where once users and creators are invested, departure is difficult; its value lies in the ecosystem connecting a vast number of users and creators."}