"fmp_official_ev":35099.9,"enterpriseValueBasis":"USD market capitalization + USD debt - USD cash and short-term investments","dcf_model_ev":59555.8,"ev_to_ebitda":7.9,"debt_to_ebitda":4.99,"net_debt_to_ebitda":4.78,"f_score":3,"f_score_breakdown":[],"fair_val":24.17,"default_fair_val":24.17,"premium_pct":-63.7,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":24,"pe_forward":21.1,"pb_trailing":1.5,"pb_forward":1.4,"div_yield":8.89,"ps_ratio":2.4,"fcf_to_ev":4.2,"fcf_to_mcap":10.57,"liab_to_assets":75.1,"cash_to_assets":2.3,"current_ratio":0.63,"roe":-15.8,"roa":-3.7,"moat":{"m1_brand_pricing":{"score":6},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":7},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":7},"m4_network_effects":{"score":5},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":8},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":6},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":7},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":7},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":7},"m10_durability":{"score":7},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"TELUS 的經濟護城河主要體現為其在高度監管行業中的特許經營權（M2），以及由此產生的規模經濟效益（M5）和廣泛的基礎設施網絡（M6）。客戶轉換成本（M3）和客戶保留策略（M9）進一步鞏固了其市場地位。雖然其品牌定價權（M1）和網絡效應（M4）相對有限，但其營運效率（M7）和業務的持久性（M10）提供了穩健的基礎。管理層的資本配置（M8）在平衡增長投資與債務管理方面面臨挑戰。總體而言，TELUS 擁有一個類似於『收費橋』的商業模式，其核心業務提供必需的連接服務，並依賴於基礎設施和監管壁壘來維持競爭優勢，護城河相對堅固。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"TELUS's economic moat is primarily characterized by its franchise-like status within a highly regulated industry (M2), leading to economies of scale (M5) and an extensive infrastructure network (M6). Customer switching costs (M3) and retention strategies (M9) further solidify its market position. While its brand pricing power (M1) and network effects (M4) are relatively limited, its operational efficiency (M7) and business durability (M10) provide a solid foundation. Management's capital allocation (M8) faces challenges in balancing growth investments with debt management. Overall, TELUS operates a 'toll bridge'-like business model, providing essential connectivity services reliant on infrastructure and regulatory barriers for competitive advantage, resulting in a relatively strong moat."},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":"staleEvidence","evidenceHash":"4f0a334e054c391c43d7a4090ebe8889425135353b8a013b1e52d652afb3afa3","currentEvidenceHash":"1f4db5650e4abd22e702cf2a564cd837d97969f69d502fea0e38a8ab7117a562"},"fScore":{"score":3,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"distress","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"CAD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-11T07:50:35.373Z","evidenceHash":"53c2a06be056241ebdfe6916b5124b8f0f7770a70ae8011db8c897bbf58dae60","mcapFx":{"asOf":"2026-11-10","from":"USD","to":"CAD","fromUsdPerUnit":1,"toUsdPerUnit":0.7089181908407769,"fromObservationDate":"2026-11-10","toObservationDate":"2026-11-06"}},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"CAD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-11-11T07:50:35.373Z","evidenceHash":"53c2a06be056241ebdfe6916b5124b8f0f7770a70ae8011db8c897bbf58dae60"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TU.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/TU.png","website":"https://www.telus.com","ceo":"Victor Dodig","full_time_employees":"111500","address":"510 West Georgia Street","city":"Vancouver","state":"BC","zip":"V6B 0M3","country":"CA","phone":"16046978044","full_address":"510 West Georgia Street, Vancouver, BC V6B 0M3, CA","range_52w":"7.64-14.84","year_high":14.84,"year_low":7.64,"all_time_high":0,"all_time_low":7.64,"inst_ownership_pct":null,"insider_ownership_pct":null,"fmp_symbol":"TU","name_en":"TELUS Corporation","expansion":{"status":"available","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T07:50:35.373Z","reason":null,"detailPath":"cache/us_companies/TU.json"},"z_score":0.74,"z_score_model":"z","z_score_zone":"distress","z_score_breakdown":[],"m_score":-3.16,"m_score_zone":"clean","m_score_breakdown":[],"fcf_to_equity":1